  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "084a5d9ba7b6ee43",
      "translationZh": "那么，你已经构建好了自己的智能体。它接收输入和工具，对其进行处理，并生成响应。它或许在做决策、检索信息、自主执行任务，或者这三者兼有。但现在，一个关键问题来了——它的表现究竟有多好？更重要的是，你怎么知道呢？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6b916fd93529d97",
      "translationZh": "构建智能体是一回事，理解它的行为则是另一回事。这正是追踪和评估发挥作用的地方。追踪让你能够清楚地看到智能体每一步都在做什么——它接收了哪些输入、如何处理信息，以及如何得出最终输出。你可以把它想象成对智能体决策过程进行的 X 光检查。而评估则帮助你衡量性能，确保智能体不只是能用，而且确实有效。它是否给出了正确的答案？它在每一步得到的结果有多大相关性？智能体的响应质量如何？它是否符合你的目标？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f1cb49cbfcb0655",
      "translationZh": "Arize Phoenix 提供了一个集中式平台，让你能够在同一个地方实时追踪、评估和调试智能体的决策。我们将深入探讨如何运用这些功能来改进和优化你的智能体。因为构建只是起点——真正的智能来自对内部运行情况的清晰了解。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bffea8bd32990b3",
      "translationZh": "为此，我们先确保已经搭建好一个智能体！你可以按照以下步骤操作，也可以使用自己的智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "38083d8c0e759e8b",
      "translationZh": "构建一个智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d7de75beb84028f8",
      "translationZh": "第 1 步：安装所需的库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1367dad191483457",
      "translationZh": "第 2 步：导入所有必要的构建模块",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b921e8485f44655d",
      "translationZh": "现在，让我们导入将要使用的类和工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "aa69be8a6249aeb8",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：设置我们的基础模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc4773d81adb42de",
      "translationZh": "我们将创建一个由 Hugging Face Hub Serverless API 驱动的模型实例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "96a8ceef7be900c5",
      "translationZh": "步骤 4：创建工具调用智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ffb5d89b8c09fa04",
      "translationZh": "步骤 5：运行智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "191a25e59bd80464",
      "translationZh": "现在，神奇的时刻到了——让我们看看智能体的实际表现。我们向智能体提出的问题是：“获取 Google 从 2020 年到 2024 年的股价，并据此绘制一张折线图？”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "478772338cae9a4a",
      "translationZh": "你的智能体现在将：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0c7e5854ea11a1d6",
      "translationZh": "使用 DuckDuckGoSearchTool 搜索 Google 的历史股价。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "01a806aeb7b3ca0f",
      "translationZh": "可能会使用 VisitWebpageTool 访问网页，以查找这些数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fefa5ad27dbfde72",
      "translationZh": "尝试收集信息，并生成折线图或描述如何创建折线图。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c0a5fefd4ef02317",
      "translationZh": "追踪你的智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "654d4a649a29c52b",
      "translationZh": "智能体运行起来后，下一个挑战就是理解其内部工作流程。追踪可以帮助你跟踪智能体执行的每一步——从调用工具到处理输入和生成响应——从而让你能够调试问题、优化性能，并确保它按预期运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84de1bc006c664c7",
      "translationZh": "为了启用追踪，我们将使用 Arize Phoenix 进行可视化，并使用 OpenTelemetry + OpenInference 进行插桩。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d692404531d02d3f",
      "translationZh": "安装 smolagents 的遥测模块：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af1bc230366ebb80",
      "translationZh": "你可以通过多种不同方式运行 Phoenix。此命令将在你的计算机上运行一个本地 Phoenix 实例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e201caa464607a8b",
      "translationZh": "至于 Phoenix 的其他托管选项，你可以创建一个免费的在线 Phoenix 实例，在本地自行托管该应用，或者将该应用托管在 Hugging Face Spaces 上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee16b949bd8f3d4f",
      "translationZh": "启动后，我们会注册一个追踪器提供程序，并将其指向我们的 Phoenix 实例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abf75a9f5fadaa09",
      "translationZh": "现在，对 smolagents 的任何调用都会发送到我们的 Phoenix 实例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f496d7cdaef93e75",
      "translationZh": "既然已经启用追踪，就让我们用一个简单的查询来测试一下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04dd221a34420d0d",
      "translationZh": "为 SmolAgents 配置好 OpenInference 后，每次智能体调用都会自动在 Phoenix 中被追踪。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b66c2df881230230",
      "translationZh": "评估你的智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8dc28df98c92f2f",
      "translationZh": "智能体启动并且其运行受到监控后，下一步就是评估它的表现。评估（evals）有助于确定智能体在检索、处理和呈现信息方面的表现如何。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18ad9af7fd969d65",
      "translationZh": "你可以开展多种类型的评估，例如回答相关性、事实准确性、延迟等。查看 Phoenix 文档，深入了解不同的评估技术。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a78476165562078",
      "translationZh": "在这个示例中，我们将重点评估智能体所使用的 DuckDuckGo 搜索工具。我们将使用一个大语言模型（LLM）作为评判者来衡量其搜索结果的相关性——具体使用的是 OpenAI 的 GPT-4o。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba50427d6f2144ac",
      "translationZh": "第 1 步：安装 OpenAI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
